      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Outputs vs mechanism: the router may serve labelled backtest RESULTS from books_corpus. should_refuse blocks mechanism - a\nproduct name plus a mechanism ask counts as specific and is refused. PII is redacted from the user message before anything is\nlogged or sent to the model.",
      "originalText": "Outputs vs mechanism: the router may serve labelled backtest RESULTS from books_corpus. should_refuse blocks mechanism - a product name plus a mechanism ask counts as specific and is refused. PII is redacted from the user message before anything is logged or sent to the model.",
